Problem Statement

Given an array arr[] and an integer K, return:

🔥 Number of subsets whose sum is exactly equal to K


1. Recursive Solution : Same pick / not-pick, but instead of OR → we add counts

int f(int index, int target, int[] arr) {
    if (target == 0) return 1;
    if (index == 0) {
        if (arr[0] == target) return 1;
        else return 0;
    }

    int notTake = f(index - 1, target, arr);

    int take = 0;
    if (arr[index] <= target) {
        take = f(index - 1, target - arr[index], arr);
    }

    return take + notTake;
}


2. Memoization (Top-Down)
int[][] dp;

int f(int index, int target, int[] arr ) {
    if (target == 0) return 1;
    if (index == 0) {
        if (arr[0] == target) return 1;
        else return 0;
    }

    if (dp[index][target] != -1) return dp[index][target];

    int notTake = f(index - 1, target, arr);

    int take = 0;
    if (arr[index] <= target) {
        take = f(index - 1, target - arr[index], arr);
    }

    return dp[index][target] = take + notTake;
}

3. Tabulation (Bottom-Up)

int countSubsets(int[] arr, int k) {
    int n = arr.length;
    int[][] dp = new int[n][k + 1];

    // Base case
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) dp[i][0] = 1;

    if (arr[0] <= k) dp[0][arr[0]] = 1;

    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
        for (int target = 0; target <= k; target++) {

            int notTake = dp[i - 1][target];

            int take = 0;
            if (arr[i] <= target) {
                take = dp[i - 1][target - arr[i]];
            }

            dp[i][target] = take + notTake;
        }
    }

    return dp[n - 1][k];
}


4. Space Optimization

int countSubsets(int[] arr, int k) {
    int[] dp = new int[k + 1];
    dp[0] = 1;

    for (int num : arr) {
        for (int target = k; target >= num; target--) {
            dp[target] += dp[target - num];
        }
    }

    return dp[k];
}


Special Case: Zeros (VERY IMPORTANT)

If array contains 0, then:

Each zero can be taken or not taken → doubles count


Fix for Zero Case
Base case correction:
if (arr[0] == 0) dp[0][0] = 2; // take or not take
else dp[0][0] = 1;